  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`sinh`](https://processes.openeo.org/#sinh) \u2014 *Hyperbolic sine*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `sinh`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nComputes the hyperbolic sine of `x`.\n\nNo-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`sinh`](https://processes.openeo.org/#sinh) ([openeo-processes/sinh.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/sinh.json)).\n",
